### Table of contents
[**1. Calling the API**](https://fal.ai/models/xai/grok-imagine-image/api#api-call)

### Submit a request [#](https://fal.ai/models/xai/grok-imagine-image/api#api-call-submit-request)
```
import { fal } from "@fal-ai/client";

const result = await fal.subscribe("xai/grok-imagine-image", {
  input: {
    prompt: "Abstract human silhouette, golden particles ready to burst outward representing joy, data visualization style, emotional expression through particles, artistic scientific"
  },
  logs: true,
  onQueueUpdate: (update) => {
    if (update.status === "IN_PROGRESS") {
      update.logs.map((log) => log.message).forEach(console.log);
    }
  },
});
console.log(result.data);
console.log(result.requestId);
```

## 2. Authentication [#](https://fal.ai/models/xai/grok-imagine-image/api#auth)
### API Key [#](https://fal.ai/models/xai/grok-imagine-image/api#auth-api-key)
```
import { fal } from "@fal-ai/client";

fal.config({
  credentials: "YOUR_FAL_KEY"
});
```

## 3. Queue [#](https://fal.ai/models/xai/grok-imagine-image/api#queue)
### Submit a request [#](https://fal.ai/models/xai/grok-imagine-image/api#queue-submit)
```
import { fal } from "@fal-ai/client";

const { request_id } = await fal.queue.submit("xai/grok-imagine-image", {
  input: {
    prompt: "Abstract human silhouette, golden particles ready to burst outward representing joy, data visualization style, emotional expression through particles, artistic scientific"
  },
  webhookUrl: "https://optional.webhook.url/for/results",
});
```

## 4. Files [#](https://fal.ai/models/xai/grok-imagine-image/api#files)
### Uploading files [#](https://fal.ai/models/xai/grok-imagine-image/api#files-upload)
```
import { fal } from "@fal-ai/client";

const file = new File(["Hello, World!"], "hello.txt", { type: "text/plain" });
const url = await fal.storage.upload(file);
```

